   "text": "GitHub Actions · ci.yml (push + PR)\n1. Python 3.13 + Node 22\n2. pip install · npm ci\n3. Vite build + oxlint\n4. pytest (live keys off)\n5. Playwright browser tests\n→ failures uploaded as artifact",
