   "text": "deploy-speclens.sh\n1. tar source (no .git · .env · var/)\n2. scp to Lightsail over SSH\n3. stream runtime.env (chmod 600)\n4. docker compose up --build\n5. poll /api/workspace/status\n6. switch current → new release\n7. --publish: Caddy + ports 80/443",
   "originalText": "deploy-speclens.sh\n1. tar source (no .git · .env · var/)\n2. scp to Lightsail over SSH\n3. stream runtime.env (chmod 600)\n4. docker compose up --build\n5. poll /api/workspace/status\n6. switch current → new release\n7. --publish: Caddy + ports 80/443",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
