   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Stateless app servers → horizontal scaling (state lives in RDS, Redis, S3)\n• Queue-based load leveling with SQS + dead-letter queue\n• Caching: CloudFront for static files, Redis for recall + rate limits\n• Database scale: read replicas, Aurora Serverless v2, RDS Proxy pooling\n• Back-pressure: WAF rate rules + per-tenant token bucket in Redis\n• Retries with exponential backoff + jitter, circuit breaker on the model API\n• Idempotency keys (SpecLens already uses correction id as document_id)\n• Multi-AZ by default · multi-region pilot-light disaster recovery later\n• Containers: ECS on Fargate, or EKS with HPA + Karpenter\n• Load tests (k6 / Locust) and chaos tests (AWS FIS) before go-live\n• Cost: AWS Budgets, Savings Plans for the base, Spot for bursts",
   "originalText": "• Stateless app servers → horizontal scaling (state lives in RDS, Redis, S3)\n• Queue-based load leveling with SQS + dead-letter queue\n• Caching: CloudFront for static files, Redis for recall + rate limits\n• Database scale: read replicas, Aurora Serverless v2, RDS Proxy pooling\n• Back-pressure: WAF rate rules + per-tenant token bucket in Redis\n• Retries with exponential backoff + jitter, circuit breaker on the model API\n• Idempotency keys (SpecLens already uses correction id as document_id)\n• Multi-AZ by default · multi-region pilot-light disaster recovery later\n• Containers: ECS on Fargate, or EKS with HPA + Karpenter\n• Load tests (k6 / Locust) and chaos tests (AWS FIS) before go-live\n• Cost: AWS Budgets, Savings Plans for the base, Spot for bursts",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
